  "card": "This PR updates TxIndex and node::GetTransaction to throw std::runtime_error on disk I/O, deserialization, or index corruption errors rather than returning null. Today, disk and index read errors are indistinguishable from absent transactions, masking hardware issues and database corruption from RPC callers. The PR also improves getrawtransaction by returning specific availability errors for pruned or un-downloaded blocks, and refactors ProcessPSBT to reuse GetTransaction.",
